include CHANGELOG.md CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md CONTRIBUTING.md LEGAL.md LICENSE README*.md SECURITY.md SUPPORT.md
include requirements-build.lock requirements-ci.lock requirements-release.lock requirements-runtime.lock requirements-security.lock
